            <div xml:id="m-e14c7a93-584f-47a0-ad36-7db8c25cb2d5">
              <lg xml:id="m-e2d66de6-14c7-4db9-8db0-b02dd609dfcc">
                <l xml:id="m-a6a4d0a5-136f-4341-b3b5-abb504c68f48" facs="#m-d88cad74-2218-4d92-97d5-5ad03f68d384" label="text-like">Common of Apostles and Evangelists.</l><l xml:id="m-2e4fc9c4-862e-4759-8ade-d7b5bc911d60" facs="#m-d9c8f8d5-c6da-468b-bff6-198e1fa91b1a" label="ambiguous">1113</l><l xml:id="m-d82bff08-8146-4487-87d4-b5b231044248" facs="#m-8cf5eb70-3eb1-46b2-a3ff-f90a32b0407f" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-38c60b52-e87f-42ca-b07a-e093a6a99556" facs="#m-d4da30b3-f9ab-4ab6-bbaf-d3fbb898f28d" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Majórem caritátem. p. 1111. Psalms of the Sunday. Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-994d0cae-659c-4e76-a4d9-8b28953b7dc6" facs="#m-bf3fe878-f94a-49fb-92bb-b1778b48ca72" label="text-like">Fratres: Jam non estis. of Vespers, p. 1115.</l><l xml:id="m-0f6b1dbe-7778-4d41-9a72-a909ae133e14" facs="#m-a4418f21-8cd5-4755-872e-dae6296a5bd2" label="ambiguous">Short</l><l xml:id="m-3901c0f0-7c34-4a91-8460-1de845f97445" facs="#m-31aa83d5-f5ac-4254-a2ee-06df2a960fe3" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-ca46b347-a80a-411d-a3f6-00f3e89d108c" facs="#m-5172d632-2170-415e-af27-f7edfbe84e52" label="lyrics-like">Nómnem térram* Exí-vit sónus e-́rum. V. Et</l><l xml:id="m-79b20883-ceea-40f3-9f41-1e5a0bf7bb6e" facs="#m-a328c051-c049-4321-9556-7118975e62a7" label="lyrics-like">in fines órbis térrae vérba e-ó-rum. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et</l><l xml:id="m-e6be5f9c-e05d-42b7-8e15-41865b6ac4fb" facs="#m-71308c06-7390-42e7-b8e8-0621fb5120de" label="lyrics-like">Fí-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-201bfd65-d444-4bd2-9d60-0e2d16fc7e28" facs="#m-cdfb522f-f6bf-4dc2-9c9a-6588fccf67ee" label="lyrics-like">V. Constitues éos príncipes super ómnem térram.</l><l xml:id="m-14138c94-1807-4d61-b8c7-bafdb8fb752b" facs="#m-5b1d8f0c-c30a-44e8-82f1-a04d686a5846" label="lyrics-like">R. Mémores érunt nóminis túi Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-014bb789-08ea-4e25-b80e-4c89b4452f5c" facs="#m-3eef936c-3ccf-49a7-8382-9c5cc9302f21" label="text-like">The Masses for Apostles and for Evangelists are found in their respective</l><l xml:id="m-3271bfa2-7a8f-4f91-acb2-5c301857f32e" facs="#m-be877a71-4e6d-433c-8cb8-7ed4471935b4" label="text-like">places, in the Proper of Saints.</l><l xml:id="m-f42d5641-9653-4e0c-a2bd-a0b830411d74" facs="#m-f7b15e3f-41ee-48f0-968f-f09371753fc1" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-2fb73a30-30ce-42ac-abd5-cdbcbf547a97" facs="#m-477001b2-89c0-4c8c-94e7-8dc64e15692b" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Vos amíci méi éstis. D. 111. Psalms of the Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-8519a88b-3111-4e7b-a88e-817c4c7aad1c" facs="#m-cb5b2827-f0fb-42a5-a032-ab46c1e216f9" label="ambiguous">Acts. 5. b.</l><l xml:id="m-d1e5a73c-967c-40bc-b627-accc6b7e1b8e" facs="#m-66b81335-1cc1-4db6-86a6-e047eec23b37" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-6c1ee5b3-fc29-428e-8242-583631cc5906" facs="#m-19ef1774-5e9a-4be1-9cd8-7cb89f933fa3" label="lyrics-like">DER manus autem Apostoló-] multa in plebe.</l><l xml:id="m-09a9aa60-c8e5-4c60-8172-9616497657dd" facs="#m-16c43cf9-7ad3-4f20-b3aa-7d54f486c47a" label="lyrics-like">B. Déo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-a34f2f98-4cb7-4eaf-9632-e27593f52231" facs="#m-2ad897ec-1c86-4f35-bcfb-31bf0465a14c" label="lyrics-like">Lrum* fiébant signa et prodigia</l><l xml:id="m-c9d1ae82-8662-4d42-98c1-2da510c9f072" facs="#m-33e37763-66bc-466b-8796-667bb83d36b2" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-3dd46a2f-b1b2-45d1-aa8e-b03ea7c21fda" facs="#m-0cfb731f-e800-4bca-9a7d-91e9200f766a" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-de49cbdc-176c-4d34-a8f6-681040494d29" facs="#m-2832c89d-10d6-408e-87a8-e5cdff9dc6b0" label="lyrics-like">Onstí-tu-es é-os príncipes “ Super ómnem térram.</l><l xml:id="m-d482ce05-51ea-4e1b-b17c-3a46ef1224c0" facs="#m-bf5cd412-4736-4ff9-b395-215509c9739f" label="lyrics-like">V. Mémores érunt nómi-nis tú-i Dómine. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-634d1698-aaf1-47db-b255-e6d5d927840c" facs="#m-5ecc7035-f410-499d-b056-776a97d6d819" label="lyrics-like">V. Nimis honoráti sunt amíci túi Déus.</l><l xml:id="m-f9538159-460b-4814-b24c-c32fbdd197dd" facs="#m-593943e9-9aa2-4f44-80c3-4dafe2127b98" label="lyrics-like">R. Nimis confortátus est principátus eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-7076a047-038d-4955-a1c5-cd13153c0b02" facs="#m-b1c22cd9-0f81-4495-b8bb-eb3bee5a7b38" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-36ffe5fc-cdb3-4a90-9f80-782a4352da18" facs="#m-d3944111-276b-4fb3-8b53-33c25e58b9a5" label="lyrics-like">Ant. In patiéntia véstra. p. 1112 Psalms of the Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-67f961df-7f8b-4fa5-aed1-fca9383bd5a1" facs="#m-563b10fb-0888-41d5-9850-05cf00bc3bad" label="ambiguous">Acts. 5. c.</l><l xml:id="m-157c9435-6528-4c95-983e-e2b0782b04a0" facs="#m-79fa2bc5-e3c7-49d7-a7e5-40a88fdd5f76" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-96aa6614-6254-4269-bef7-a65ee82f257a" facs="#m-24d8793f-66fe-4a78-ab01-9e27bc4ff895" label="lyrics-like">Bant Apóstoli gaudéntes a con-] hábiti sunt pro nómine Jesu contu¬</l><l xml:id="m-0c48e64d-7a04-493f-9b80-7c2c0ddd9b4b" facs="#m-7165812c-08e4-4409-a76a-ecf0a035d349" label="lyrics-like">L spéctu concilii, * quóniam dignil méliam pati.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>